  "goodToKnow": "Das Innenministerium is the interior ministry, like the UK Home Office. The federal one, the BMI, is responsible for internal security, the federal police, migration and civil protection, and since 2018 its full name is Bundesministerium des Innern und für Heimat. Each of the 16 Länder also has its own Innenministerium, since police are mainly a state matter. Der Innenminister is the minister. Plural: die Innenministerien."
